      "description": "How to reach alerts and runbooks for this dashboard.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1000
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Alerts on this dashboard are evaluated by Prometheus**, not Grafana.\nAlertmanager (local default) routes everything to a no-op receiver; alerts are\nvisible at [Alertmanager UI](http://localhost:9095) and via the Prometheus\n**Alerts** page. Resolve/silence there.\n\n**Runbooks** (repo-relative paths):\n- `IranDirectPrefixChecksFailing` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/prefix-check-failures.md`\n- `IranDirectDnsLookupFailureRatioHigh` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/dns-lookup-failures.md`\n\nAll runbooks: `deployment/observability/runbooks/`"
      }
